            </span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
            <span
                    class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-[#4CAF50]/10 text-[#4CAF50] rounded-full text-label-small font-bold mb-4"
            >
              ECOINDEX A/B
            </span>
                        <h4 class="text-headline-small font-bold mb-2 text-[#2E7D32]">
                            Indicateurs éco-conçus
                        </h4>
                        <p class="text-body-medium text-on-surface-variant">
